[{"sha":"3b8bad4252652995d5b95467d39befc79a1a26db","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDNiOGJhZDQyNTI2NTI5OTVkNWI5NTQ2N2QzOWJlZmM3OWExYTI2ZGI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3b8bad4252652995d5b95467d39befc79a1a26db","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3b8bad4252652995d5b95467d39befc79a1a26db","author":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T16:40:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T16:40:51Z"},"tree":{"sha":"cbd7d67c13168a357c886330fbedd2dcb45f67c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/cbd7d67c13168a357c886330fbedd2dcb45f67c2"},"message":"feat(mapper): add SendDirectUpdate method for direct MapResponse delivery\n\nAdd SendDirectUpdate method to LockFreeBatcher to enable sending MapResponse\nmessages directly to specific nodes without going through the change broadcast\nsystem. This is useful for targeted updates like PingRequests that need to be\ndelivered immediately to a specific node.\n\nThe method:\n- Validates the MapResponse and node existence\n- Checks for active connections\n- Sends directly via the node's send method\n- Logs delivery status for debugging\n\nThis lays the groundwork for implementing ping functionality that requires\ndirect node communication.\n\nRelated to #2902","parents":[{"sha":"eb788cd007119472b99787c8c3af6d6204e8b834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/eb788cd007119472b99787c8c3af6d6204e8b834","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/eb788cd007119472b99787c8c3af6d6204e8b834"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAARcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAEBANLHmfZ/tH39b44j6zg9Cf\nEDuSaDwUbQd1QSaH/3ZEechpGdLrCVWspLY+M/WusCFv2O6RhwYdl3uh07Z2KuBoCSUcy8\nFlTGdvoXPkpspT7MtYMN7n0oL7IOJ5jvFS2IIg8lhUbutjVO45O162haDrxRMLGOqTEhsy\neDBQEPhjEfuNBYMs+JjY4iPa2IjyucrusTzHzhfPrJCSmvfMy9tOZBiCh65+9RRpuKXODy\nGGS48+wSUHB8RvtWLBTHWmj8WMGnt4u9B6560pQLu3+6Vo3ToLs7CFa1MGKSV3eqiqMMtP\nDtE2jLJuWthqTn0xfsH/d3rcp1jB6vUhH66SQhb/0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIA\nAAEUAAAADHJzYS1zaGEyLTI1NgAAAQCjYnUuAgbcHoZ5xfH2OLnOBKhIR6JJP3OSxibbNQ\nGY9o40sXU7oLKDfOTlzvZ8zC289P9F7hvGxhcQ7be3tk1aFnPH4n801k7wO0R1hmoSTti8\nDRXrm5Tjtw3PFf8OVNVDOf3KizD8elSFRhX0O5ttbDpd1bM1DGJkyFtAUpYzeqC3yHJxL6\n+OnGzfEffLvOZo1YOb6hE6XftkOih33ulfBLolaKz7WAySQaOzNsSPn717RFWXIj0r9sOp\nOvNrd0TPFA1JlqHyeEU0SOa0yUXSwdLZ07NCT+ooDxL0JXb9Z+5ojJnUyVNDztwuRKKC1k\nu31ZL2x+U0TX2Vv6Qnu7gv\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree cbd7d67c13168a357c886330fbedd2dcb45f67c2\nparent eb788cd007119472b99787c8c3af6d6204e8b834\nauthor Rogan Lynch <roganl@gmail.com> 1764952851 -0800\ncommitter Rogan Lynch <roganl@gmail.com> 1764952851 -0800\n\nfeat(mapper): add SendDirectUpdate method for direct MapResponse delivery\n\nAdd SendDirectUpdate method to LockFreeBatcher to enable sending MapResponse\nmessages directly to specific nodes without going through the change broadcast\nsystem. This is useful for targeted updates like PingRequests that need to be\ndelivered immediately to a specific node.\n\nThe method:\n- Validates the MapResponse and node existence\n- Checks for active connections\n- Sends directly via the node's send method\n- Logs delivery status for debugging\n\nThis lays the groundwork for implementing ping functionality that requires\ndirect node communication.\n\nRelated to #2902\n","verified_at":"2025-12-06T00:52:42Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"27e7d10285d373c26fc389f20deab4c1458924bb","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDI3ZTdkMTAyODVkMzczYzI2ZmMzODlmMjBkZWFiNGMxNDU4OTI0YmI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/27e7d10285d373c26fc389f20deab4c1458924bb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/27e7d10285d373c26fc389f20deab4c1458924bb","author":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T16:55:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T16:55:16Z"},"tree":{"sha":"1b426316c2f100f93583e07c08c61693d79c4e78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/1b426316c2f100f93583e07c08c61693d79c4e78"},"message":"feat(ping): add core PingRequest/Response implementation\n\nAdd core ping functionality for node health checks and connectivity testing.\n\nThis PR implements:\n- PingManager: manages ping request lifecycle, tracking, and response handling\n- PingRequest types: support for disco, TSMP, and c2n ping types\n- Noise protocol integration: authenticated ping response handler\n- HTTP endpoint: /machine/ping-response/{request_id} for receiving responses\n- Batcher interface extension: SendDirectUpdate method for direct message delivery\n\nThe PingManager creates unique ping requests with callback URLs, tracks them\nwith timeouts, and coordinates responses. The Noise protocol ensures only\nauthenticated nodes can submit ping responses.\n\nThis builds on the SendDirectUpdate capability added in the previous commit\nand provides the foundation for gRPC ping endpoints and the scheduler.\n\nRelated to #2902","parents":[{"sha":"3b8bad4252652995d5b95467d39befc79a1a26db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3b8bad4252652995d5b95467d39befc79a1a26db","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3b8bad4252652995d5b95467d39befc79a1a26db"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAARcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAEBANLHmfZ/tH39b44j6zg9Cf\nEDuSaDwUbQd1QSaH/3ZEechpGdLrCVWspLY+M/WusCFv2O6RhwYdl3uh07Z2KuBoCSUcy8\nFlTGdvoXPkpspT7MtYMN7n0oL7IOJ5jvFS2IIg8lhUbutjVO45O162haDrxRMLGOqTEhsy\neDBQEPhjEfuNBYMs+JjY4iPa2IjyucrusTzHzhfPrJCSmvfMy9tOZBiCh65+9RRpuKXODy\nGGS48+wSUHB8RvtWLBTHWmj8WMGnt4u9B6560pQLu3+6Vo3ToLs7CFa1MGKSV3eqiqMMtP\nDtE2jLJuWthqTn0xfsH/d3rcp1jB6vUhH66SQhb/0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIA\nAAEUAAAADHJzYS1zaGEyLTI1NgAAAQBmWlr2CAdx51jsBXFLplAnyiZH1xUpFeyAg9cNco\nqdqF0urNfJCnZYmle7W3qN+c63RYJ7AjhSCyXeZfNtzfvKwbOUOHUCeC3fXDfGr0dqmaUO\nVsPeCAKqTJbHsOXBfDMM+RnZmSe1NsjtL44UicSyjprVIcuxyUhWUisfaq/lM/EgPskg25\n8bmlAi571ReG3AMyRvq1ke0PFiCUFdsvwRD9GDWjw0z3JOJfKZpLHs2BJ6BMxUBPMz7HYx\nc/32ENNrbHSdDPDssJkgOyWEKhqkWbrxP1rISHyQ3qZ6jcqGVVzXHXJ3Iidvl8KOtlXKcE\nL21bOeIsP3ZUVFfTnHpD0H\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 1b426316c2f100f93583e07c08c61693d79c4e78\nparent 3b8bad4252652995d5b95467d39befc79a1a26db\nauthor Rogan Lynch <roganl@gmail.com> 1764953716 -0800\ncommitter Rogan Lynch <roganl@gmail.com> 1764953716 -0800\n\nfeat(ping): add core PingRequest/Response implementation\n\nAdd core ping functionality for node health checks and connectivity testing.\n\nThis PR implements:\n- PingManager: manages ping request lifecycle, tracking, and response handling\n- PingRequest types: support for disco, TSMP, and c2n ping types\n- Noise protocol integration: authenticated ping response handler\n- HTTP endpoint: /machine/ping-response/{request_id} for receiving responses\n- Batcher interface extension: SendDirectUpdate method for direct message delivery\n\nThe PingManager creates unique ping requests with callback URLs, tracks them\nwith timeouts, and coordinates responses. The Noise protocol ensures only\nauthenticated nodes can submit ping responses.\n\nThis builds on the SendDirectUpdate capability added in the previous commit\nand provides the foundation for gRPC ping endpoints and the scheduler.\n\nRelated to #2902\n","verified_at":"2025-12-06T00:52:42Z"},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"e4f6362853ca2334cc5cec49f32e7d18e3139977","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGU0ZjYzNjI4NTNjYTIzMzRjYzVjZWM0OWYzMmU3ZDE4ZTMxMzk5Nzc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e4f6362853ca2334cc5cec49f32e7d18e3139977","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e4f6362853ca2334cc5cec49f32e7d18e3139977","author":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T17:14:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"Rogan Lynch","email":"roganl@gmail.com","date":"2025-12-05T17:14:13Z"},"tree":{"sha":"0614c86b6c44196e38737356bbf3608172e9594e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/0614c86b6c44196e38737356bbf3608172e9594e"},"message":"Add ping scheduler for node liveness checks\n\nThis commit implements a configurable ping scheduler that periodically\nchecks node liveness by sending PingRequest messages. This helps detect\noffline nodes faster than TCP timeouts and supports scenarios like subnet\nrouter failover.\n\nKey features:\n- Configurable ping interval, jitter, and timeout\n- Disabled by default to maintain backward compatibility\n- Distributed ping scheduling to avoid load spikes\n- Proper lifecycle management (start/stop with headscale)\n- Comprehensive test coverage\n\nConfiguration options in config.yaml:\n- node_liveness.enable_scheduler: Enable/disable the scheduler\n- node_liveness.ping_interval: How often to check all nodes\n- node_liveness.ping_jitter: Random jitter to distribute pings\n- node_liveness.ping_timeout: Timeout for individual pings\n\nPart of the PingRequest feature split as requested in review.","parents":[{"sha":"27e7d10285d373c26fc389f20deab4c1458924bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/27e7d10285d373c26fc389f20deab4c1458924bb","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/27e7d10285d373c26fc389f20deab4c1458924bb"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAARcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAEBANLHmfZ/tH39b44j6zg9Cf\nEDuSaDwUbQd1QSaH/3ZEechpGdLrCVWspLY+M/WusCFv2O6RhwYdl3uh07Z2KuBoCSUcy8\nFlTGdvoXPkpspT7MtYMN7n0oL7IOJ5jvFS2IIg8lhUbutjVO45O162haDrxRMLGOqTEhsy\neDBQEPhjEfuNBYMs+JjY4iPa2IjyucrusTzHzhfPrJCSmvfMy9tOZBiCh65+9RRpuKXODy\nGGS48+wSUHB8RvtWLBTHWmj8WMGnt4u9B6560pQLu3+6Vo3ToLs7CFa1MGKSV3eqiqMMtP\nDtE2jLJuWthqTn0xfsH/d3rcp1jB6vUhH66SQhb/0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIA\nAAEUAAAADHJzYS1zaGEyLTI1NgAAAQBo4hoeKFsgWUELmborPyJOq26RzW/WHvHDxFRRvU\nbkoJU1UZBRRuyXQP5XO9Eq8KxkW6YkFA8TbyKb5Mz5zXaoKEon9o1QxpKIuD4O31gcHHwi\nLoqAt6W3eV2FmuXSCZnKSmuPRNIIt8ev3zqlVGsnU2IaSx5uPezOPP3nXZSQ+ywXwv+6ZY\nLGG/zlg5dE+d5A/wdeyhvVvS1USSKVfyDZfcjhB4N9Zlb7IwOVymcyg75N98x3W6b8waCs\nbCGzO5QXG1Jmc7eJn0OBbFF3cykIBE30XX92IKkk7F/WgtDqGkBtn/yvi1yqpvT/2E/iBx\n6xwFwayYFd0tI1DAy7o84A\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 0614c86b6c44196e38737356bbf3608172e9594e\nparent 27e7d10285d373c26fc389f20deab4c1458924bb\nauthor Rogan Lynch <roganl@gmail.com> 1764954853 -0800\ncommitter Rogan Lynch <roganl@gmail.com> 1764954853 -0800\n\nAdd ping scheduler for node liveness checks\n\nThis commit implements a configurable ping scheduler that periodically\nchecks node liveness by sending PingRequest messages. This helps detect\noffline nodes faster than TCP timeouts and supports scenarios like subnet\nrouter failover.\n\nKey features:\n- Configurable ping interval, jitter, and timeout\n- Disabled by default to maintain backward compatibility\n- Distributed ping scheduling to avoid load spikes\n- Proper lifecycle management (start/stop with headscale)\n- Comprehensive test coverage\n\nConfiguration options in config.yaml:\n- node_liveness.enable_scheduler: Enable/disable the scheduler\n- node_liveness.ping_interval: How often to check all nodes\n- node_liveness.ping_jitter: Random jitter to distribute pings\n- node_liveness.ping_timeout: Timeout for individual pings\n\nPart of the PingRequest feature split as requested in review.\n","verified_at":"2025-12-06T00:52:42Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":21395467711,"node_id":"RRE_lADOEFLz887clNEizwAAAAT7RO2_","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/21395467711","actor":{"login":"roganlynch","id":44678921,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0Njc4OTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44678921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch","html_url":"https://github.com/roganlynch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/followers",